                <invention-title lang="de">VALIDIERUNG VON ROUTING-INFORMATIONEN IN EINER NETZWERKSTRUKTUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">VALIDATION D'INFORMATIONS DE ROUTAGE DANS UNE MATRICE DE RÉSEAU</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VALIDATION OF ROUTING INFORMATION IN A NETWORK FABRIC</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Systems, methods, and computer-readable media for validating routing table information in a network. A method may include retrieving routing information from a plurality of nodes. It is then determined that at least one of the plurality of nodes cannot reach a sink vertex based on the routing information to yield a determination. Finally a node isolation event or a node black hole event is generated based on the determination.</p>
            </abstract>
